# Pizza Hut Sales Analysis Using SQL Server

### Project Overview
An end-to-end SQL analysis project exploring Pizza Hut sales data through 13 business questions to understand sales performance, product demand, and revenue contribution.

### Business Objectives
- Analyse total orders and sales revenue.
- Identify popular pizza types and sizes.
- Evaluate category-wise product demand.
- Understand hourly ordering patterns.
- Identify top revenue-generating products.
- Analyse revenue contribution and cumulative sales trends.

### SQL Concepts Used
- INNER JOIN
- GROUP BY and ORDER BY
- Aggregate Functions (SUM, COUNT, AVG)
- Common Table Expressions (CTEs)
- Window Functions
- DENSE_RANK
- DATEPART

### Business Value
The analysis supports data-driven decisions around product promotion, menu planning, inventory management, operational efficiency, and revenue improvement.

### Tools
**Microsoft SQL Server | SQL Server Management Studio (SSMS)**

### Project Outcome
Demonstrates the practical application of SQL in converting transactional sales data into business-focused analysis and actionable recommendations.
